WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.825 --> 00:00:09.215
Welcome to Fixer Nation Education. This video walks you through accepting your school's license quote, so you can get your school set up.

2
00:00:09.717 --> 00:00:20.767
Your quote arrives by email, with a subject line that says, your Fixer Nation Education license quote, and your quote number. If you can't find it, check your spam folder.

3
00:00:21.269 --> 00:00:25.369
Select the button that says Accept Quote to open your quote page.

4
00:00:25.869 --> 00:00:40.279
Take a minute to review what's on the page: your school, the quote number, the license, the number of teacher seats, the date the quote is valid until, and the total. If anything looks off, contact us before you accept.

5
00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:49.170
You can pay in one of two ways. The first tab is for schools that pay by purchase order. The second tab is for paying by credit card.

6
00:00:49.672 --> 00:00:59.782
If you choose credit card, select Pay now, and you'll be taken to a secure Stripe checkout page to finish. Your card details are never entered on our site.

7
00:01:00.283 --> 00:01:06.193
This time we'll use a purchase order. Go back to the first tab, and enter your P-O number.

8
00:01:06.695 --> 00:01:19.135
A quick note for purchase order schools. Your license switches on after our team confirms the purchase order, so there can be a short wait before you can invite teachers. Select, Submit your purchase order.

9
00:01:19.637 --> 00:01:27.387
Your order is confirmed, and a confirmation email is on its way. Next, the page asks who will run your school's account.

10
00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:38.437
If that's you, you're the School License Administrator. Because you paid by purchase order, you can set your password right now. Select, Set your password now.

11
00:01:38.938 --> 00:01:49.778
If someone else will manage the account, such as a technology coordinator or a principal, choose, Invite someone else to manage the account, and enter their email address.

12
00:01:50.279 --> 00:02:00.999
Select Send invite. They'll get an email with a link to create their account. The link works for seven days and can be used once. Each quote can send one invitation.

13
00:02:01.501 --> 00:02:07.631
If you paid by card, the link to set your password is in the confirmation email we send you instead.

14
00:02:08.132 --> 00:02:16.962
Either way, the next step is your welcome email, which we cover in the first video of this series. Thanks for choosing Fixer Nation Education.
